config RTL8723BU
	tristate "Realtek RTL8723BU USB Wi-Fi (vendor driver)"
	depends on USB && CFG80211
	select WIRELESS_EXT
	select WEXT_PRIV
	---help---
	  Vendor driver for the Realtek RTL8723BU USB Wi-Fi/Bluetooth
	  combo chip (for example the Edimax 7392:a611). It is built as
	  the module 8723bu. Needs rtl_bt/rtl8723b_fw.bin for Bluetooth
	  (loaded by btusb); the Wi-Fi firmware is built into the driver.

	  If unsure, say N.
